<title>USA: McGraw-Hill Cos Inc Q3 shr increases.</title>
<headline>McGraw-Hill Cos Inc Q3 shr increases.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.15		    $1.06</p>
<p> Net			114,508		  105,822</p>
<p> Operating rev	  949,009		  904,351</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  99,477		   99,960</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.88		    $1.73</p>
<p> Net			187,866		  172,614</p>
<p> Operating rev	2,243,794		2,185,681</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 100,109		   99,704</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - First Call mean estimate for 1996 Q3 was $1.15 per share</p>
<p>Average number of common shares reflects two-for-one stock split approved by the company on January 31, 1996. The 1995 figures have been restated to reflect the split.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
